	<summary><![CDATA[If there's someone on Discord claiming to be me, they're trying to scam you. No one from Valve or Steam Support will ever contact you over Discord, or any other social / chat service, including Steam chat itself. Instead, all Steam's support issues are resolved directly through Steam's support site at  <a class="bb_link" href="https://help.steampowered.com/" target="_blank" rel="" >https://help.steampowered.com/</a> <br><br>I don't have the ability to take down scammer Discord accounts, so please report any such scammers to Discord at:<br> <a class="bb_link" href="https://steamcommunity.com/linkfilter/?u=https%3A%2F%2Fsupport.discord.com%2Fhc%2Fen-us%2Farticles%2F360000291932-How-to-Properly-Report-Issues-to-Trust-Safety" target="_blank" rel=" noopener" >https://support.discord.com/hc/en-us/articles/360000291932-How-to-Properly-Report-Issues-to-Trust-Safety</a> <br><br>]]></summary>


